            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.5.34+ACT.5.35+ACT.5.36+ACT.5.37+ACT.5.38+ACT.5.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 5.34-39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “An Lajudaya, ginywala i Taruco i Cilicia, ento adoŋo i gaŋ man, lapwonynya obedo Gamaliel. Gipwonya ki cik pa kwarowa kun gimiyo agwokke twatwal; abedo ki nyeko pi Lubaŋa macalo wun bene wutye kwede tin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 8.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.9+ACT.26.10+ACT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26.9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abedo ka libo jo me Yo ma, anekogi bene. Atweyogi, aterogi i mabuc, co wa ki mon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ajwaka madit pa Lubaŋa ki kacokke pa ludoŋo gin aye cadenna i kom lok man. Alimo waraga ki botgi pi utmego, ci acako wot i Damaciko ka mako jo ma gitye kunnu ki tweyogi me akela kany i Jerucalem wek giket can i komgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I kare ma atye ka wot ma doŋ anyiko cok ki Damaciko, cwiny dyeceŋ, ci dero madit oa ki i polo, oryeny ocaro koma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka apoto piny, awinyo dwan ma wacca ni, ‘Caulo, Caulo, piŋo itye ka yela?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An agamo ni, ‘In aŋa, Rwot?’ Ci owacca ni, ‘An aye Yecu ma itye ka yela-ni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo ma guwoto kweda guneno dero, ento pe guwinyo dwan ŋat ma tye ka lok kweda-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci agamo ni, ‘Atim gin aŋo, Rwot?’ Ci Rwot owacca ni, ‘A malo idony i Damaciko, ci gibititti ki kunnu gin ducu ma yam giyubo ni myero iti.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka pe doŋ aneno piny pi dero meno ma ocaro waŋa, ci jo ma gitye kweda gupeya ki ciŋa nio wa i Damaciko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ŋat mo ma nyiŋe Anania, dano ma woro Lubaŋa kun lubo cikke ducu, ma Lujudaya ducu ma gitye kunnu giloko nyiŋe maber, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obino bota, ci ocuŋ ka ŋeta, owacca ni, ‘Ominwa Caulo, wek waŋi doŋ oyabbe!’ Ci waŋa oyabbe woko i cawa meno cut, ka aneno kome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci owacca ni, ‘Lubaŋa pa kwarowa oyero in wek iŋe gin ma en mito, inen Ŋat ma Kite Atir, iwiny bene ka en loko ki doge; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pien in ibibedo cadenne bot dano ducu pi gin ma ineno ki ma iwinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dok pud ikuro aŋo? Doŋ ia malo gibatija in, gilwok balli woko kun ilwoŋo nyiŋe.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka atyeko dwogo i Jerucalem, ka atye ka lego i ot pa Lubaŋa, awille woko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci anene. En owacca ni, ‘Rune oyot, ia woko ki i Jerucalem, pien pe gibiye lok me caden ma itito pira.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agamo ni, ‘Rwot, gin kikomgi giŋeyo ni i kacokke acel acel abedo ka pwodo dano ma guye in, atweyogi bene i mabuc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.58"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 7.58",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Dok i kare ma gineko lacadenni Citefano an onoŋo acuŋ kunnu apwoyo gin ma otimme, agwoko bene boŋo pa jo ma guneke.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci owacca ni, ‘A woko ki kany, pien abicwali ka mabor bot Lurok.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gubedo ka winyo nio wa i lok man; ento ka doŋ oloko, gucako daŋŋe ki dwan maloŋo ni, “Wutere, wuneke woko! Dano macalo meno pe romo bedo i lobo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gubedo ka daŋŋe matek, ma giteŋo boŋŋigi, gidunyo apwa malo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapten ociko ni giter Paulo i gogo, ci gipenye kun gipwode ki del wek eniaŋ gin mumiyo gidaŋŋe i kome kit meno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ka doŋ gityeko tweye ki del, Paulo oloko ki ladit ma loyo dano miya ma ocuŋ ka ŋete ni, “Cik ye ni gipwod dano ma Laroma ma peya giŋolo kop oloye bo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ladit meno owinyo, ci ocito bot kapten, owacce ni, “Man ibitimo niŋniŋ? Dano man Laroma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci kapten obino bote openye ni, “In Laroma?” Ogamo ni, “Iyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.27"
            ]
          }
